{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_73","type":"agent_message","text":"The requested analysis points to downregulation.\n\nI copied the Galaxy seed history, ran DESeq2 for CBD_IC50 versus DMSO using the 6 matched samples, filtered to padj < 0.05 and |log2FC| > 0.5, then ran GO Biological Process enrichment separately for upregulated and downregulated genes. Metabolic GO:BP enrichment was driven by downregulated genes (e.g., carbohydrate metabolic process), while upregulated genes showed no metabolic enrichment under the default correction and far fewer metabolic terms under FDR.\n\nThe canonical answer has been written to [answer.txt](/workspace/codex_output/answer.txt)."}}
